   "body": "/claim cloud/i966-opus\n\nPlan:\n- Read ADR 0013 (+ Amendments 1–2), the LOT-172 iCloud list sync and the LOT-067 rehost history store.\n- Add a versioned KVS key for the 100 newest rehost uploads; merge by id (union, newest first, cap 100); tolerant decoding so an older build ignores it.\n- Wire it into the existing iCloud sync: push/merge at activation, same Apple-ID change / quarantine / initial-sync rules as the lists.\n- Swift Testing: two-device merge, cap, activation push, account change, older-build/unknown-version tolerance.\n- ADR 0013 amendment in the same PR; draft PR with `compile-check`, Fable adversarial review.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
